Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.71,0:00:08.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)游马 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.13,0:00:21.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(等{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}々{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}力)投票的结果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.75,0:00:23.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}下一任委员长是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.08,0:00:26.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}九十九游马同学。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.26,0:00:30.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.56,0:00:30.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)哎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.12,0:00:32.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}定下来了哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.51,0:00:33.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.38,0:00:35.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你看 游马当上委员长了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.64,0:00:38.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇 我！？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.89,0:00:40.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(真月)我这是为你好{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.14,0:00:43.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是我推荐了游马同学哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.57,0:00:45.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真月 你又多管闲事。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.85,0:00:48.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过 没想到居然真的当选了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.97,0:00:50.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(铁男)啊啊 吓我一跳。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.16,0:00:52.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.43,0:00:52.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小猫)喵！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.44,0:00:55.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我倾注了爱意的一票起作用了呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.12,0:00:57.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(诚)哟，游马委员长！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.70,0:00:59.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马委员长{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}｡\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(太一)好好干啊。\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马委员长。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.86,0:01:01.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(幸)游马委员长，加油哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.15,0:01:02.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}加油！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.79,0:01:03.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}期待你哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.08,0:01:07.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道说，我被超级期待了？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.22,0:01:10.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(星光)游马，在我看来，你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.51,0:01:12.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并没有成为集团领袖的资质…。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.65,0:01:15.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好～了，那么接下来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.55,0:01:18.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们班允许提前吃午饭，不许迟到。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.85,0:01:20.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自习时间就用来决斗吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.12,0:01:22.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.53,0:01:22.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.58,0:01:24.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《如果我…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.32,0:01:26.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果我不再是委员长的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.80,0:01:27.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底…》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.36,0:01:40.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《神宫寺：九十九游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.63,0:01:45.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}屡次迟到 还恬不知耻地偷吃午饭。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.02,0:01:47.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}莫名其妙的自言自语。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.90,0:01:50.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把校内风纪搅得一团乱
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.91,0:01:52.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙居然是委员长！？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.14,0:01:54.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不可能！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.97,0:01:57.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(怒)没错 不可能！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.03,0:01:58.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怒大人。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.64,0:02:00.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦 学生会长。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.30,0:02:03.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们这帮家伙 人都到齐了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.35,0:02:06.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连一个好主意都想不出来 是怎么回事。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.11,0:02:08.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那 那个…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.79,0:02:09.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.90,0:02:11.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}干掉九十九游马的作战{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.33,0:02:13.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有没有什么点子？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.82,0:02:16.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有 当然有。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.63,0:02:20.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}入学以来 两年三个月零十一天
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.32,0:02:22.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一直担任学生会长{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.61,0:02:24.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被称为King Of 学生会长
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.98,0:02:25.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我神宫寺守。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.03,0:02:28.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}由怒大人赐予
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.54,0:02:30.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用这张卡，一定要……。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.88,0:02:33.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我很期待哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.71,0:02:26.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（大家）为了巴里安世界！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.29,0:04:14.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我当学生会直属的风纪指挥？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.89,0:04:16.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯，你愿意接受吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.65,0:04:19.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}维护班级秩序{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.29,0:04:22.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你作为委员长的本事真是了不起。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.58,0:04:25.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}学生会会长居然一直在关注我{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.26,0:04:28.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说到底真是太感激了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.73,0:04:31.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这份工作，是你的话一定能完成。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.87,0:04:33.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.80,0:04:35.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好的，我很乐意！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.03,0:04:40.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}锵！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.64,0:04:43.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（德之助）呐，那是什么？背面？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.84,0:04:45.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是 No.俱乐部的会员证哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.24,0:04:49.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎！？难道说那个是铁男君做的？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.53,0:04:52.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是当然，大家的份也有哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.24,0:04:54.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的乌拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.12,0:04:56.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喵——好感动！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.82,0:04:59.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}铁男君这个我也想要！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.48,0:05:01.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}请把我也加进Number's Club吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.09,0:05:05.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊，那下次你的会员证也……。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.37,0:05:15.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）委……委员长！？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.61,0:05:18.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}吓……吓我一跳，别吓人啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.43,0:05:19.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}干嘛啊？那身打扮。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.35,0:05:22.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在的我并不是委员长。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.85,0:05:26.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而是学生会直属的特命风纪指挥官！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.56,0:05:27.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特命风纪……。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.29,0:05:29.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}指挥官？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.18,0:05:31.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喵那是啥？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.70,0:05:32.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特命风纪指挥官
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.99,0:05:35.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}负责检查学生的校规违反情况{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.27,0:05:37.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并拥有给违反者记点的权限，
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.21,0:05:38.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是被赋予这项权力的存在。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.31,0:05:39.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}铁男君
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.85,0:05:42.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把不必要的东西带进校内{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.20,0:05:43.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}违规积分 1！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.01,0:05:47.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}顺便说一下违规积分攒到10分就停学。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.35,0:05:51.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}30分可是要退学的哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.05,0:05:53.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(大家)哎哎～!?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.19,0:06:03.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦 原来是这样啊。还有这种事啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.70,0:06:05.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喵！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.50,0:06:08.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在校内和猫对话 禁止！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.19,0:06:10.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喵什么喵!?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.38,0:06:13.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说起来 刚才上课的时候…。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.17,0:06:21.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}迷你裙 禁止。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.43,0:06:22.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟们)这是制服啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.23,0:06:26.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}禁止搞鬼！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.48,0:06:28.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我还什么都没做呢呜啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.92,0:06:31.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇 糟了！ 要迟…。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.78,0:06:31.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}迟到禁止！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.27,0:06:35.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}提前吃午饭禁止！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.12,0:06:36.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}禁止潜水！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.31,0:06:39.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}禁止打开插口！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.44,0:06:42.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}禁止偷懒逃避值日！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.69,0:06:43.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}禁止！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.74,0:06:47.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(等{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}々{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}力)禁止违反校规！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.86,0:06:52.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底你是想怎样啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.30,0:06:55.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}想怎样是指？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.90,0:06:58.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么都要违规违规的开什么玩笑。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.50,0:07:01.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是因为游马君你违反校规啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.29,0:07:03.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算这样也太过分了吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.65,0:07:05.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并不过分。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.16,0:07:06.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}话说回来
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.85,0:07:08.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你有什么权限{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.48,0:07:10.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对特命风纪指挥官
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.11,0:07:11.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抱怨不满啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.16,0:07:13.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么权限啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.99,0:07:15.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因……因为我是委员长啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.88,0:07:17.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(神宫寺)九十九游马君。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.58,0:07:20.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(等{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}々{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}力)学生会会长！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.12,0:07:23.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来你对学生会的方针
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.29,0:07:24.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有异议啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.27,0:07:25.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.01,0:07:28.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么 不如就在这里{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.71,0:07:30.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用你最擅长的决斗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.40,0:07:32.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来做个了断吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.96,0:07:34.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果你赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.23,0:07:36.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就废除特命风纪指挥官。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.32,0:07:39.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真的吗？ 那我现在就……。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.92,0:07:40.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.48,0:07:42.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}既然是在校内进行{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.98,0:07:45.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗也得遵守校规哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.70,0:07:46.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.16,0:07:47.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.05,0:07:51.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么 特命风纪指挥官。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.18,0:07:53.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗中校规违规的检查{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.75,0:07:54.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就拜托你了。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.12,0:07:55.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.13,0:07:56.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.87,0:08:02.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗盘 设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.41,0:08:07.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}D视镜 设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.81,0:08:14.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}AR影像 连接完成。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.56,0:08:15.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（2人）决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.20,0:08:19.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}先手我拿下了！ 我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.70,0:08:22.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从手牌召唤 嘎嘎嘎魔术师！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.71,0:08:26.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拜托了 嘎嘎嘎魔术…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.84,0:08:29.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}违反！ 校规违反！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.07,0:08:31.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈？ 校规违反！？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.39,0:08:35.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}长裙穿着！ 花哨的配饰！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.43,0:08:36.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凶器携带！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.39,0:08:40.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无论哪样都是重大的校规违反！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.91,0:08:45.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么 特命风纪指挥官什么样的处分比较合适呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.09,0:08:47.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}停学一周！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.91,0:08:50.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}总而言之请回到手牌里去！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.62,0:08:54.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这… 这到底是怎么回事啊！？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.95,0:08:56.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我应该说过吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.40,0:08:58.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗也要遵守校规。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.61,0:09:03.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也就是说，违反校规的怪兽不能召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.84,0:09:04.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么会！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.24,0:09:06.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都怪你不小心接受了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.60,0:09:08.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可疑的决斗，才会变成这样。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.22,0:09:09.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没办法了吧！嘿～！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.44,0:09:13.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖放一张卡，回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.51,0:09:24.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.24,0:09:30.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从手牌发动永续魔法纪律的镜舞台！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.22,0:09:32.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在这张魔法发动期间
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.66,0:09:34.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自己场上存在的怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.23,0:09:37.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全部变成原本的攻击力、守备力。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.90,0:09:41.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后，召唤模范巫女 玉串！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.77,0:09:50.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂！明明是等级6，为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.85,0:09:52.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}能突然召唤出来啊！？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.58,0:09:57.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原来是通过把攻击力变成零
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.69,0:09:59.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就能不用解放来召唤吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.30,0:10:01.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真的假的！？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.12,0:10:04.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 委员长！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.40,0:10:06.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那条裙子违反校规了吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.28,0:10:08.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不用检查一下吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.62,0:10:13.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因永续魔法 纪律之镜舞台的效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.81,0:10:15.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自己场上的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.64,0:10:17.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全部变回原本的攻击力。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.29,0:10:18.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(玉签)是的！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.31,0:10:20.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有什么问题吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.80,0:10:22.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(等{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}々{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}力)不 没有问题。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.96,0:10:27.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一切都在计算之中吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.51,0:10:31.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}furthermore 我特殊召唤优等生神官{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}榊{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.88,0:10:35.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这只怪兽 在自己场上
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.14,0:10:37.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有巫女时 可以特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.05,0:10:39.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等级6有两只吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.92,0:10:41.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 要来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.91,0:10:44.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将 等级6的模范巫女玉签和
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.47,0:10:46.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}优等生神官{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}榊{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}进行超量！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.94,0:10:49.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用两只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.01,0:10:50.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建超量网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.33,0:10:52.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.00,0:10:57.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}遵守规则降临吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.10,0:10:58.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}风纪宫司典侍！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.67,0:11:01.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧！风纪宫司典侍！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.75,0:11:03.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对九十九游马直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.44,0:11:08.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动陷阱 攻击无敌化！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.66,0:11:11.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用这个把对我的伤害变成零。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.44,0:11:14.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}违反规则的作弊我绝不允许！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.19,0:11:17.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动风纪宫司典侍的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.86,0:11:19.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}消耗一个超量素材{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.06,0:11:21.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将对方的魔法·陷阱
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.74,0:11:22.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无效并破坏！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.11,0:11:27.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 上啊 典侍！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.11,0:11:40.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖一张卡 回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.20,0:11:44.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.39,0:11:46.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 就算你召唤
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.95,0:11:49.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可能违反校规的怪兽也是没用的。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.84,0:11:52.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算你这么说啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.11,0:11:54.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对了！就算违反校规
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.76,0:11:56.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要不被发现就行了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.21,0:12:00.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用里侧守备表示 把怪兽SET！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.60,0:12:02.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么样！这样一来就算
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.32,0:12:04.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}触犯了校规也不会被发现吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.15,0:12:07.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}平时就不断违反众多校规的经验{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.08,0:12:09.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来在这里派上了用场。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.54,0:12:14.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱卡发动 突击检查！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.85,0:12:16.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以将场上的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.44,0:12:17.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1只里侧守备怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.12,0:12:20.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变为表侧守备表示！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.15,0:12:26.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}糟了 嘎嘎嘎嘎女孩！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.57,0:12:29.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘎嘎嘎！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.60,0:12:33.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}违规 校规违规！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.28,0:12:36.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}裙子太短。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.08,0:12:39.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}诡异的配饰。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.61,0:12:43.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}穿着暴露度过高的制服。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.66,0:12:47.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还有 那头金发简直不可饶恕！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.01,0:12:51.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯～ 这么多的校规违规叠加起来的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.94,0:12:53.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当然要停学！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.77,0:12:57.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}总而言之给我回到手牌里去！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.40,0:12:58.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还没完！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.13,0:13:00.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}速攻魔法 清场长袍发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.37,0:13:03.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡在自己场上
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.13,0:13:04.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有1只怪兽离开时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.29,0:13:07.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将攻击力 守备力变为零
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.04,0:13:09.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让那只怪兽留在场上！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.33,0:13:12.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么样！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.43,0:13:15.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凭借清场长袍的效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.20,0:13:16.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要看不见身影
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.31,0:13:17.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就不会触犯校规。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.24,0:13:18.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.33,0:13:21.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我说过不许耍滑头还没明白吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.46,0:13:24.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}法理人的怪兽效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.60,0:13:26.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用1个超量素材
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.50,0:13:28.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将魔法·陷阱无效化{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.69,0:13:30.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破坏那张卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.98,0:13:35.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}结果 我我我少女返回手牌！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.33,0:13:40.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我我我少女！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.69,0:13:42.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}前辈！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.19,0:13:47.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶！ 这样下去的话…。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.89,0:13:50.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}冷静点 游马 这里是不会战斗的哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.73,0:13:51.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？ 啊…。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.34,0:13:55.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从手牌发动不会战斗的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.70,0:13:58.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只有对方场上有怪兽存在{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.87,0:14:01.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自己的魔法或陷阱被无效的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.68,0:14:03.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把这张卡送去墓地
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.26,0:14:06.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给对手造成1500点伤害！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.84,0:14:13.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好 游马 从这里开始反击！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.38,0:14:13.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.83,0:14:17.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把这种自私任性的规则强加于人的家伙{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.53,0:14:18.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不可能是正确的！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.61,0:14:22.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用魔法卡 死者苏生{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.79,0:14:25.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从对方墓地选模范巫女玉串{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.12,0:14:26.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以守备表示特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.84,0:14:29.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇 我的怪兽……
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.77,0:14:32.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错！ 这家伙原本就是你的怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.11,0:14:35.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来就不算违反校规了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.46,0:14:39.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖一张卡 回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.06,0:14:42.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不可原谅 不可原谅！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.48,0:14:45.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不可原谅～！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.86,0:14:47.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特命风纪指挥官！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.77,0:14:50.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对玩家的攻击是彻头彻尾的校内暴力！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.47,0:14:52.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以无效！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.91,0:14:53.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可 可是……
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.18,0:14:56.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}风纪宫司则理的直接攻击
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.62,0:14:58.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不也没问题吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.38,0:15:01.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没关系！ 而且那家伙还偷了别人的东西。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.43,0:15:04.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是严重的校规违反！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.67,0:15:06.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在立刻把九十九游马开除学籍！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.28,0:15:09.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再怎么说 这也太乱来了……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.54,0:15:11.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是 太乱来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.37,0:15:15.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可为什么你要去帮那种家伙啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.73,0:15:17.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么要去当什么风纪委员长！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.05,0:15:18.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.35,0:15:22.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因为这也是没办法的事啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.37,0:15:24.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不再是委员长的我
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.95,0:15:27.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就只能变成别的什么了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.09,0:15:30.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不然的话不再是委员长的我{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.22,0:15:33.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底该被怎么称呼才好啊！？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.89,0:15:36.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别人怎么称呼你根本无所谓！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.11,0:15:39.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你又不是为了被人叫做委员长{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.93,0:15:41.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}才去当委员长的对吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.46,0:15:47.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《没错 我哪怕只是一点点也想为大家出一份力。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.44,0:15:51.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}想打造一个好的班级所以才当了班长》
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.93,0:15:56.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 我……。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.22,0:16:00.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}沿着自己相信的道路勇往直前！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.70,0:16:01.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是 热血沸腾！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.49,0:16:04.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让我看看你的热血沸腾！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.47,0:16:09.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的热血沸腾。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.95,0:16:13.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马同学 请看着吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.17,0:16:15.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是等{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}々{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}力孝的……。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.27,0:16:18.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}轰天热血沸腾！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.81,0:16:21.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好嘞～！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.73,0:16:26.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这场决斗已经和校规没有关系了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.15,0:16:28.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马同学 总而言之{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.08,0:16:30.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}请全力发挥吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.95,0:16:31.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.23,0:16:35.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《一个个的都在反抗我》
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.06,0:16:38.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.85,0:16:43.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从手牌发动 升阶魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.82,0:16:45.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}异晶人之力！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.81,0:16:47.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.66,0:16:48.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}异晶人！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.69,0:16:51.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以将自己的怪兽超量
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.33,0:16:52.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}升阶{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.60,0:16:55.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤混沌超量怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.49,0:16:57.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用风纪宫司 诺利特
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.25,0:16:59.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}重构叠放网络。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.14,0:17:02.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌超量 变身！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.10,0:17:07.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 混沌超量
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.84,0:17:10.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}风纪大宫司 赛蒙！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.82,0:17:16.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上了 发动赛蒙的怪兽效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.05,0:17:19.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}取除一个混沌叠放单位{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.57,0:17:22.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将对方一只怪兽的表示形式变更。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.89,0:17:25.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来了 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.58,0:17:27.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.35,0:17:28.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这下就是最后一击了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.01,0:17:32.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}风纪大宫司 赛门攻击模范巫女 玉串！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.34,0:17:42.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}见识到混沌仪式的力量了吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.48,0:17:47.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呼，好险啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.91,0:17:49.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我在受到攻击之前{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.70,0:17:51.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用了陷阱卡 半不破
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.90,0:17:52.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是这样。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.50,0:17:55.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因为半不破的效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.42,0:17:57.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}受到攻击的1只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.24,0:17:59.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在这个回合的战斗中不会被破坏。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.24,0:18:02.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且 那场战斗发生的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.22,0:18:04.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对玩家的伤害减半。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.01,0:18:06.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}耍这种小聪明。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.82,0:18:09.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动速攻魔法 双重检查！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.46,0:18:13.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将在这个回合的战斗中未能破坏的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.94,0:18:15.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1只怪兽破坏。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.65,0:18:18.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}虽然总算是撑过去了{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.77,0:18:20.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马同学的生命值只剩300。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.49,0:18:23.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么想 这样下去都……
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.71,0:18:26.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别担心 委员长。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.29,0:18:30.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这次 就让你见识见识我的燃烧斗志！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.68,0:18:32.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.57,0:18:34.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.66,0:18:35.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上啊 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.66,0:18:35.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.96,0:18:39.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤 我我我魔术师！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.79,0:18:47.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再发动魔法卡 我我我之风！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.63,0:18:50.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从手牌把名字带有 我我我 的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.86,0:18:53.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1只怪兽等级提升1级{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.09,0:18:54.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.64,0:18:57.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我我我少女 停学解除！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.65,0:18:59.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让等级4的我我我少女和
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.77,0:19:01.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我我我魔术师 叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.26,0:19:05.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用2只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.47,0:19:07.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.08,0:19:09.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.77,0:19:13.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 No.39！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.39,0:19:15.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望皇 霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.50,0:19:21.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就这点程度怎么可能打倒混沌超量！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.14,0:19:26.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我我我女孩的怪兽效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.06,0:19:27.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.63,0:19:29.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和名字带有我我我的怪兽一起{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.63,0:19:31.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}成为超量单位的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.50,0:19:34.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对方场上的1只怪兽超量
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.28,0:19:35.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力变成零。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.90,0:19:38.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.02,0:19:40.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}劈开它 霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.82,0:19:42.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}燃起来了 我！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.29,0:19:45.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击风纪大宫司赛蒙！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.09,0:19:47.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普剑斩！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.59,0:20:13.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咦？ 我到现在都在做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.00,0:20:16.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来洗脑解除了。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.79,0:20:17.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.88,0:20:22.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（铁男）从真月那里听说就慌忙赶过来了。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.25,0:20:24.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马君{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}｡\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（真月）没事吧？\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马君。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.10,0:20:26.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（真月）我以为是为你好的。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.25,0:20:29.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大家！对不起！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.06,0:20:32.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 我…有点不正常了。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.04,0:20:35.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以对大家做了那么过分的事。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.36,0:20:39.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(铁男)算了吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.92,0:20:42.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是啊 别在意。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.72,0:20:44.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就那种程度要是每次都生气的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.70,0:20:46.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我啊 可是每天都要
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.27,0:20:47.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}向大家道歉的啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.78,0:20:51.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大家 愿意原谅我吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.02,0:20:53.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那当然了！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.33,0:20:57.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因为我们可是伙伴啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.34,0:21:00.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}伙伴…吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.34,0:21:04.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大家 真的谢谢你们。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.06,0:21:06.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯 也是出于好意。帅呆了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.27,0:21:11.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 班长辞掉了呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.50,0:21:14.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好不容易都当选了，太可惜了。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.13,0:21:16.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没事啦。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.69,0:21:18.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那种事，有比我
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.29,0:21:20.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}合适得多的家伙在呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.65,0:21:24.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大家！请回到座位上。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.51,0:21:30.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.13,0:21:32.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}学生会室已经用不了了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.02,0:21:35.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样的话得去找个新的据点才行。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.22,0:21:38.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.42,0:21:44.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(智太郎) 谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.76,0:21:51.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.79,0:21:53.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}画这个看起来很厉害的家伙是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.59,0:21:57.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我、是我啦……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.27,0:22:00.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我看上了！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.09,0:22:03.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就让你当本大爷的小弟吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.45,0:23:42.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.42,0:23:46.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.61,0:23:48.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.66,0:23:51.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.56,0:23:54.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.93,0:23:59.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.96,0:24:01.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.20,0:24:06.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.60,0:24:09.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}

